Institute;
f) the qualifications of teachers of the Institute;
g) the classifications, the method of appointment and determination of
the terms and conditions of service of teachers and other staff of
the Institute;
h) the constitution of pension, insurance and provident funds for the
benefit of the officers, teachers and other staff or the Institute;

